    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's a heavy thought. \"ultimate control\"... it feels like the only thing that doesn't feel like a mistake anymore. but i worry about the others. if i just... make that choice, will they see it as me taking control, or will they just see another person who couldn't handle the weight? how do i make sure it feels like a resolution instead of just more tragedy?",
